  "description": "JOYSTAR Totem Kids Bike - BMX Style Bicycles\nFuel their sense of adventure with the JOYSTAR Totem Kids Bike. Designed with a rugged BMX-inspired aesthetic and engineered for safety, the Totem is the perfect first pedal bike for boys and girls ready to explore the neighborhood.\n\nRugged BMX styling meets everyday durability: The JOYSTAR Totem in Blue.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Built to withstand every sidewalk stunt and driveway race, the Totem combines a heavy-duty steel frame with intuitive safety features for total peace of mind.\"\nSuperior Safety Systems\nThe Totem features a High-Tensile HI-TEN steel frame that provides a stable, shock-absorbing ride. For reliable stopping power, it utilizes an intuitive rear coaster brake (pedal backwards to stop). Larger 18\" and 20\" models include a front caliper hand brake to help riders transition to adult braking systems.\n\nIntuitive braking and a reinforced frame for a safe learning experience.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nFull Chain Guard: Fully enclosed to prevent grease from touching clothing and keep fingers safe from moving parts.\n\nAll-Terrain Grip: 2.125\" wide pneumatic rubber tires offer excellent traction on pavement, gravel, and grass.\n\nGrowth-Friendly: Quick-release seat post and adjustable handlebars ensure a perfect fit as your child grows.\n\nCustom Style: Each bike comes with DIY decals so kids can personalize their ride.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nGet riding faster with JOYSTAR’s effortless setup. The Totem arrives 85% pre-assembled. All required tools and clear instructions are provided, allowing for a complete assembly in roughly 20 minutes.\n\nEasy Assembly: See how quickly the Totem goes from box to sidewalk.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Action\n\nWatch the JOYSTAR Totem tackle the park with ease.\n\nOur Guarantee\nJOYSTAR provides a competitive warranty structure that rivals premium brands to give you total peace of mind:\n\nThe Frame (Lifetime): Steel and aluminum frames are guaranteed against faulty materials and workmanship for as long as the original purchaser owns the bicycle.\n\nThe Components (2 Years): Most non-wear parts (such as the handlebars, fork, and crankset) are covered for 2 years against manufacturing defects.\n\nRegistration Bonus: JOYSTAR often extends a Limited Lifetime Warranty to the original owner if the bike is registered on our official website shortly after purchase.\n\nCustomer Support: Our team is ready to assist with any issues or assembly questions to ensure a safe ride.",
